- research-stack: port v3 SKILL.md with 11 focus lenses (references/focus/), the
  tag manifest, the tool registry, focus_check.py and the focus-aware validator.
  Dropped the power tier, config reading and notes-vault paths; person-specific
  connectors became generic "if your team has one" registry entries.
- devproto.py: FOCUS_HINTS mirrors tags.json triggers; when the research row is
  on, start/status suggest /research-stack --focus <tags> from the goal.
- Lane docs and callers (planning, karpathy, brainstorm, pathway, design) pass
  focus tags through; 1pct sends external unknowns to focused research.
- Tests: test_focus.py, focus fixtures, devproto focus-hint tests.
- Version 2.1.0, CHANGELOG and UPDATES entries. Source lock left unchanged.

